team use, and sharing with other hosts. Forking and pull requests are welcome.

**Not allowed:** selling it, packaging it into paid products, courses or asset packs,
or running it as a paid public service.

**Attribution required.** Do not remove credit and claim it as your own original work.

No warranty. Use at your own risk, and back up your data.
